{"path":"index.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
  <title>{{BUSINESS_NAME}} — Clinical Support for Steady Living</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Practical psychotherapy and ongoing clinical coaching for people juggling work, family, and life transitions. Membership options for regular support and short-term consultations.">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="assets/css/styles.css">
</head>
<body class="layout-zen">
  <header class="site-header">
    <div class="container">
      <a class="brand" href="/">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</a>
      <nav class="main-nav" aria-label="Primary">
        <a href="/about.html">Who I Am</a>
        <a href="/approach.html">How I Work</a>
        <a href="/specialties.html">Focus Areas</a>
        <a href="/fees.html">Plans &amp; Access</a>
        <a href="/book.html" class="cta">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
      </nav>
      <button class="try-btn" id="open-try">Try it now</button>
      <button class="menu-toggle" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="main-menu">Menu</button>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section class="hero reveal" id="hero">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="hero-inner">
          <h1>Clinical partnership for persistent life shifts — small, steady steps.</h1>
          <p class="lead">I work with adults seeking durable emotional steadiness: clearer boundaries, calmer days, and more reliable coping. Weekly therapy, short-term work, and a membership option for ongoing practice support.</p>
          <div class="hero-actions">
            <a class="primary" href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
            <button id="open-try-cta" class="secondary">Try a short exercise</button>
          </div>
          <p class="meta">Sessions provided in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}. Telehealth available. Confidential clinical care; see footer for notes on scope and crisis.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="myth-truth reveal" id="myth_vs_truth">
      <div class="container">
        <h2>Common misunderstandings, clarified</h2>
        <ul class="grid">
          <li>
            <strong>Myth:</strong>
            <p>Therapy must be long-term to help.</p>
            <strong>Grounded view:</strong>
            <p>Short, focused work can shift patterns; some needs do benefit from ongoing collaboration. We choose the scope together.</p>
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Myth:</strong>
            <p>Change requires perfect discipline.</p>
            <strong>Grounded view:</strong>
            <p>Small, repeatable practices are more sustainable. We design steps that match your life.</p>
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Myth:</strong>
            <p>Therapy is only for crisis.</p>
            <strong>Grounded view:</strong>
            <p>Therapy can be preventive, supportive, and skills-oriented, not only reactive care.</p>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="pillars reveal" id="pillars">
      <div class="container">
        <h2>How I structure support</h2>
        <div class="cards">
          <article>
            <h3>Short-term Focused Work</h3>
            <p>Targeted 6–12 session plans for specific goals — transitions, skills, or crisis stabilization.</p>
          </article>
          <article>
            <h3>Continuity Circle</h3>
            <p>A monthly membership for steady support: one session per month, guided home-practice resources, and asynchronous check-ins. Designed for people who want ongoing presence without weekly sessions.</p>
          </article>
          <article>
            <h3>Flexible Clinical Consults</h3>
            <p>Single-session consultations for specific questions, referrals, or feedback between regular care.</p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="case-notes reveal" id="case_notes">
      <div class="container">
        <h2>Illustrative notes (anonymized)</h2>
        <ol>
          <li>
            <p><em>Client A</em> — built a simple nightly routine; distress decreased and sleep improved incrementally over six weeks. Work focused on behavioural experiments and compassion-based reflection.</p>
          </li>
          <li>
            <p><em>Client B</em> — used brief check-in consults during a job transition to maintain grounding and reduce overwhelm; tailored practices supported clearer decisions.</p>
          </li>
        </ol>
        <p class="clinician">These vignettes are composite and anonymized. They describe typical therapeutic approaches rather than promises of outcome.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="faq reveal" id="faq">
      <div class="container">
        <h2>Questions people ask</h2>
        <dl>
          <dt>Do you take insurance?</dt>
          <dd>I do not bill insurance directly in most cases; I can provide a superbill for clients to submit to their insurer. We can discuss options during booking.</dd>
          <dt>What happens in a membership?</dt>
          <dd>Members receive one scheduled session per month, secure messaging check-ins, and curated practice materials. Membership is intended as ongoing supportive care rather than crisis-only access.</dd>
          <dt>How is confidentiality handled?</dt>
          <dd>Clinical records are maintained in a secure manner. Communications may have limitations depending on platform; we will review boundaries at intake.</dd>
        </dl>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="cta reveal" id="cta">
      <div class="container">
        <h2>Ready to start a steady path?</h2>
        <p>If you're curious about working together, schedule a connection call. We’ll clarify concerns, scope, and a plan aligned with your life.
        </p>
        <div class="actions">
          <a class="primary" href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
          <a class="secondary" href="/contact.html">Contact &amp; Intake</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer class="site-footer">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="footer-left">
        <p>&copy; <span id="year"></span> {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</p>
        <p>Phone: <a href="tel:{{PHONE}}">{{PHONE}}</a> • Email: <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">{{EMAIL}}</a></p>
      </div>
      <div class="footer-right">
        <p>Confidentiality: Clinical notes are maintained in secure records. Limits to confidentiality include imminent harm to self/others or mandated reporting. This site does not replace emergency services. If you are in crisis, contact your local emergency number or crisis line immediately.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </footer>

  <!-- Guided exercise modal -->
  <div id="try-modal" class="modal" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="modal-dialog" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="try-title">
      <button class="modal-close" id="close-try">Close</button>
      <h3 id="try-title">Short practice</h3>
      <p class="muted">Choose one to try for a few minutes. This is a self-directed tool and not a substitute for clinical care.</p>
      <div class="try-tabs">
        <button data-mode="breath" class="active">Breathing</button>
        <button data-mode="journal">Journaling</button>
        <button data-mode="intention">Set an intention</button>
      </div>
      <div class="try-views">
        <div class="view" data-mode="breath">
          <div class="breath-visual" id="breath-visual" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" class="breath-svg"><circle cx="50" cy="50" r="20" /></svg>
          </div>
          <p class="prompt">Follow the circle. Breathe in for 4, hold 2, out 6. Click Start when you're ready.</p>
          <div class="controls">
            <button id="start-breath">Start</button>
            <button id="stop-breath" disabled>Stop</button>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="view" data-mode="journal" hidden>
          <p class="prompt">Write for five minutes about what feels most important right now. Save locally when done.</p>
          <textarea id="journal-text" placeholder="Write here..." rows="8"></textarea>
          <div class="controls">
            <button id="save-journal">Save</button>
            <button id="clear-journal">Clear</button>
          </div>
          <p class="muted small">Saved entries are stored locally on this device.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="view" data-mode="intention" hidden>
          <p class="prompt">Set a short intention for the next day or week. A brief reminder will appear while the modal is open.</p>
          <input id="intention-text" placeholder="I intend to..." />
          <div class="controls">
            <button id="save-intention">Save intention</button>
            <button id="clear-intention">Clear</button>
          </div>
          <p class="muted small">Intentions are stored locally and meant as a gentle nudge, not a prescription.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <script src="assets/js/main.js" defer></script>
</body>
</html>"} 
